ocument gives:", "options": {"A": "Train list", "B": "Staff list", "C": "Tenders", "D": "Broad financial picture"}, "answer": "D", "i": "q1uqlusv10v4"}, {"q": "Supplementary Demands documents seek:", "options": {"A": "Additional grants", "B": "Fare cuts", "C": "Staff", "D": "Loans"}, "answer": "A", "i": "qcukswvze3u"}, {"q": "Excess Grants regularize:", "options": {"A": "Savings", "B": "Earnings", "C": "Expenditure beyond grants", "D": "Loans"}, "answer": "C", "i": "qxzh9ps6iux"}, {"q": "The Appropriation Accounts show:", "options": {"A": "Future plans", "B": "Grant-wise actuals against grants", "C": "Tenders", "D": "Staff"}, "answer": "B", "i": "q1mh6ts9yvxl"}, {"q": "The CAG's report on Appropriation Accounts is examined by:", "options": {"A": "DRM", "B": "GM", "C": "Railway Board", "D": "Public Accounts Committee"}, "answer": "D", "i": "qzvra3eb02j"}, {"q": "Charged items in the Demands for Grants are shown:", "options": {"A": "Separately, not put to vote", "B": "With voted items", "C": "Hidden", "D": "After March"}, "answer": "A", "i": "q2ekueorqnbj"}, {"q": "The Budget Manual of the Railways lays down:", "options": {"A": "Fares", "B": "Timetables", "C": "Procedure for estimates and budget", "D": "Staff conduct"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q2ezjh70pw6j"}, {"q": "The Estimates Committee of Parliament examines:", "options": {"A": "Fares", "B": "How estimates could be more economical", "C": "Tenders", "D": "Staff"}, "answer": "B", "i": "q2gje73g5m5e"}, {"q": "The Performance Budget links:", "options": {"A": "Fares to costs", "B": "Staff to trains", "C": "Zones", "D": "Outlays to physical targets"}, "answer": "D", "i": "qm4o9d77sxe"}, {"q": "The first separate Railway Budget was presented in:", "options": {"A": "1924-25", "B": "1947-48", "C": "1950-51", "D": "2017-18"}, "answer": "A", "i": "qucti0e43lx"}, {"q": "Budget documents are prepared in:", "options": {"A": "Hindi only", "B": "English only", "C": "English and Hindi", "D": "Regional languages"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q30ebtsi8qn"}, {"q": "The Memorandum explaining the Finance Bill provisions relates to:", "options": {"A": "Railways", "B": "Taxation proposals", "C": "Fares", "D": "Staff"}, "answer": "B", "i": "qcsi65p43xe"}, {"q": "The Receipts Budget shows:", "options": {"A": "Expenditure", "B": "Staff", "C": "Loans only", "D": "Revenue and capital receipts"}, "answer": "D", "i": "q2at6uf9wajx"}, {"q": "The Expenditure Budget volume details:", "options": {"A": "Major expenditure heads and schemes", "B": "Fares", "C": "Timetables", "D": "Staff list"}, "answer": "A", "i": "qyvmicymby0"}, {"q": "Budget documents include statements of:", "options": {"A": "Trains", "B": "Staff", "C": "Assets and liabilities", "D": "Tenders"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q21y58dqjfpc"}, {"q": "The Key Features of Budget document:", "options": {"A": "Is secret", "B": "Summarizes budget highlights", "C": "Lists staff", "D": "Gives tenders"}, "answer": "B", "i": "qvv3063pvnc"}, {"q": "After the merger, railway finances are presented as:", "options": {"A": "Separate fund", "B": "Hidden", "C": "Unchanged legally", "D": "Part of General Budget documents"}, "answer": "D", "i": "qt6k6gkyy15"}, {"q": "The Railway Minister's Budget Speech was delivered in:", "options": {"A": "Parliament", "B": "Board office", "C": "Zones", "D": "Stations"}, "answer": "A", "i": "q14hds5snv8u"}, {"q": "Money can be withdrawn from the Consolidated Fund only:", "options": {"A": "By DRM order", "B": "By GM order", "C": "Under appropriation made by law", "D": "By CAG"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q1yexxjsx7jw"}]